                                "sense_id": "b604578c-4551-3e03-8ffc-72a4a92cfbd2",
                                "text": "A thick forest of pine trees encircles their subdivision, and beyond that, in the distance, is the shadow of the mountain, one of those low hills at the cusp of Appalachia in northern Alabama."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
